Talaria

The history-insertion technique in crates/talaria-tui/src/terminal.rs (a scroll region
that starts at the top of the screen, newline-driven scrolling inside it, and
reverse-index to slide the live viewport down when there is room below it) follows
the approach of OpenAI Codex's codex-rs/tui/src/insert_history.rs in openai/codex,
